      "writtenOn": "2025-02-13T00:14:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like the non-essential thread won\u0027t reboot. Are the threads we create for the FPMCU started as essential threads or non-essential threads? i.e., if you call `exit()` in `fpsensor.cc`, will it reboot?",
