      "writtenOn": "2025-02-14T09:37:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Are the threads we create for the FPMCU started as essential threads or non-essential threads?\n\nAs non-essential. The last argument of the [CROS_EC_TASK](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/include/shimmed_task_id.h;l\u003d178) macro. So it won\u0027t reboot (new version of `exit` - thread abort). The newlib Zephyr hooks just do while(1), so I guess the watchdog should reboot.",
      "parentUuid": "0e4cb9ac_e4a47fb1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 44,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 44,
        "endChar": 47
